# M22 / Jev — WORKER-ONLY secret, loaded by news-intelligence alone.
#
# Deliberately NOT in the shared .env: that file is loaded by all twelve services via
# `env_file: ../.env`, and a text-classification credential has no business in the trading
# engine, the gateway or the ranking service.
#
# Copy to `.env.jev` on EC2 (gitignored by the `.env.*` rule) and restart news-intelligence.
# Leaving it absent is a supported state — the container starts, and Jev makes no request.
#
# This key alone does NOT enable anything: `jev_enabled` is a separate admin flag that
# defaults OFF, so a configured key with the flag off still makes zero provider calls.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
